Package: cudacellr
Title: GPU-Aware Single-Cell Analysis Workflows for R
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides experimental R-native single-cell analysis primitives
    for sparse count matrices, including library-size normalization,
    log-normalization, highly variable feature selection, principal component
    analysis, and nearest-neighbour construction. Integrates the 'cudaverse'
    numerical and sparse layers from 'cudaverse' while preserving R matrix
    conventions.
    Optional adapters preserve native 'SingleCellExperiment' and
    'SeuratObject' version 5 object structures.
